{"guidance_id": "ext_6f0b8c1b15636ce256578f69", "text": "5、6、10号门为临时港湾式上下车区域，参展车辆可靠边即停即走。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "drop_off", "route_or_location": "5、6、10号门", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "参展车辆", "action": "可靠边即停即走", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_c4654f3d8322459b56728cd4", "evidence_id": "evd_831ce37ac6615cdb3707f3a2", "extraction_id": "ext_6f0b8c1b15636ce256578f69"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_c352d5c7a279db0728513801", "text": "展会期间每天15:00至18:30，出租车上客点设置在会展中路2号通道，展场西路南行右1、右2车道；会展南三路路边设置非集结出租车临时上客点。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "drop_off", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "15:00至18:30", "vehicle_scope": "出租车", "action": "上客", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_c4654f3d8322459b56728cd4", "evidence_id": "evd_60e6641090138657c3bca856", "extraction_id": "ext_c352d5c7a279db0728513801"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_1e9cba646351c73e8818597e", "text": "请广大市民朋友尽量选择公共交通工具前往。建议乘坐地铁（8号线琶洲站或新港东站、11号线琶洲站）或公交出行。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "public_transport", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_c4654f3d8322459b56728cd4", "evidence_id": "evd_a4e399493c955a8244b2da0e", "extraction_id": "ext_1e9cba646351c73e8818597e"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_854f8812f3b5e3264d1405c4", "text": "车辆向西行驶可从火炬路转至安和路进青兰高速，也可从火炬路行驶至河套、胶州；向东行驶可从火炬路转至岙东路，也可从火炬路一直向东行驶至市区、城阳。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "egress", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "车辆", "action": "行驶", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_2625987e499d8aa22af767e9", "extraction_id": "ext_854f8812f3b5e3264d1405c4"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_250a141f89040fd73015e00e", "text": "田海路（火炬路以北）车辆可经田海路、尚信路、振和路向东或西方向行驶进入火炬路。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "egress", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "田海路（火炬路以北）车辆", "action": "行驶", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_1b96f64e3ceb3552b7da7161", "extraction_id": "ext_250a141f89040fd73015e00e"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_215b5880daa8353a52aecd73", "text": "田海路（火炬路以南）车辆可从火炬路田海路路口左转或右转进入火炬路。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "egress", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "田海路（火炬路以南）车辆", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_9d00fbe0f16ca1b84d297dd1", "extraction_id": "ext_215b5880daa8353a52aecd73"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_39951b8762e0626e45180441", "text": "观众可乘地铁8号线直达健身中心（红岛会展）站；也可乘地铁1号线或3号线至“青岛北站”，换乘地铁8号线至健身中心（红岛会展）站；从健身中心（红岛会展）站C出入口出站，沿火炬路向东步行，可到达青岛市民健身中心体育场北门。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "public_transport", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_489b843331394f4134ffa75e", "extraction_id": "ext_39951b8762e0626e45180441"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_b86e6a3c31ecb5de7a80a801", "text": "开车的观众可将车辆停放至大洋、科技馆地铁站，乘坐8号线至健身中心（红岛会展）站，避免场馆周边交通拥堵。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "public_transport", "route_or_location": "大洋、科技馆地铁站", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": "避免场馆周边交通拥堵"}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_aa49d0035f34b01b19a01382", "extraction_id": "ext_b86e6a3c31ecb5de7a80a801"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_b917cb1f1bd9a636adbc4c92", "text": "请提前关注路况信息，合理安排出行路线和方式，途经车辆尽量绕行管制区域。演出期间，公安交管部门将根据现场交通流量情况，适时调整管控措施，驾车人员请配合现场工作人员指挥。管制期间带来不便，敬请谅解。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": "演出期间"}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_3703bae0353147c752ff50ba", "evidence_id": "evd_c9a244c47b9c05a2141cb46a", "extraction_id": "ext_b917cb1f1bd9a636adbc4c92"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_8c9982f82e1913b86ddbbdc4", "text": "沿滨江大道至同心路驶往楚门方向", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_eddb361ecbf84108f9f4bbf7", "evidence_id": "evd_bca385004bf5cce2c1662630", "extraction_id": "ext_8c9982f82e1913b86ddbbdc4"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_2e0a8e46b04a433351007c9e", "text": "滨江大道机动车道两侧允许机动车有序单排停放。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "parking", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "16:00—19:30", "vehicle_scope": "机动车", "action": "允许机动车有序单排停放", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_eddb361ecbf84108f9f4bbf7", "evidence_id": "evd_8dc779f35c965181678f5c09", "extraction_id": "ext_2e0a8e46b04a433351007c9e"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_791b2eb22d5f11153eed07c9", "text": "社会车辆可绕行辛柴路、国瑞路、海河南道等道路", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_fd3228f759d7e62004cadf23", "evidence_id": "evd_05292eb01ee91a5599f6d46c", "extraction_id": "ext_791b2eb22d5f11153eed07c9"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_a63cbbc0c02a435a73ca12c6", "text": "社会车辆可绕行天津大道、辛柴路、海河南道等道路", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_fd3228f759d7e62004cadf23", "evidence_id": "evd_0a5296cafc76e839e6ef9e1b", "extraction_id": "ext_a63cbbc0c02a435a73ca12c6"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_18242f5e7490349186db12ab", "text": "社会车辆可绕行海河南道、辛柴路、国瑞路等道路", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_fd3228f759d7e62004cadf23", "evidence_id": "evd_b92241cbd6008a2cb49eb559", "extraction_id": "ext_18242f5e7490349186db12ab"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_586ec565e0620a2092029dc5", "text": "社会车辆可绕行东文南路、东沽路、南慧路（因道路施工，限高3.5米）、雅正路、津沽公路、机场大道（张满庄路）等道路", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "detour", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_fd3228f759d7e62004cadf23", "evidence_id": "evd_3850d4c1a875d1080fb2657d", "extraction_id": "ext_586ec565e0620a2092029dc5"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_31e1e36dfd0721c045190235", "text": "社会车辆可停放在国家会展中心南区P3、P4、P5、P6、P13停车场；国家会展中心北区P7、P9、P10、P11、P12以及国展大道临时停车场", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "parking", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_fd3228f759d7e62004cadf23", "evidence_id": "evd_77b21df0d5ccbb9b8523b790", "extraction_id": "ext_31e1e36dfd0721c045190235"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_5d34fb97c95a93002d959579", "text": "在中新城上城停放的车辆，可从奥林路、奥体路出口驶出，经奥体路往袁家岗方向行驶。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "egress", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "", "vehicle_scope": "在中新城上城停放的车辆", "action": "", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_159aacacd1b5adb6f6bd12d7", "evidence_id": "evd_46fcd0f084dc020ee1e1c09a", "extraction_id": "ext_5d34fb97c95a93002d959579"}
{"guidance_id": "ext_dc0024e061d1f0543635acde", "text": "进场期间，市民可在龙腾大道上行轨道奥体中心公交车站、奥体东路金茂珑悦奥体中心公交车站临时上下客，车辆需即停即走，不得临停等候。", "attributes": {"guidance_type": "drop_off", "route_or_location": "", "time_text": "进场期间", "vehicle_scope": "", "action": "临时上下客，车辆需即停即走", "condition": ""}, "review_status": "pending", "source_id": "src_159aacacd1b5adb6f6bd12d7", "evidence_id": "evd_c366a784b36361f352f44e85", "extraction_id": "ext_dc0024e061d1f0543635acde"}
